2356 0 obj
  << /ActualText (All guests travelling to Manyoni Ridge Safari Lodge are required to arrange comprehensive travel insurance as soon as their booking is confirmed\056\n\nIt is the guest\047s responsibility to confirm that their policy provides sufficient cover\054 including but not limited to trip cancellation or shortening\054 medical treatment\054 emergency medical evacuation\054 hospital stays\054 illness or injury\054 personal liability\054 stolen or lost belongings\054 travel delays\054 and return transport home\056\n\nManyoni Ridge Safari Lodge cannot be held liable for any expenses\054 losses\054 or claims that result from situations typically covered under a travel insurance policy\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 2357 0 R
     /Pg 576 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

