     /P 2374 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 576 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

2358 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Experiencing wildlife in its own habitat is one of the defining rewards of a safari\054 and guests recognise that taking part in safari activities and entering protected wilderness areas carries an inherent element of risk\056\n\nManyoni Ridge Safari Lodge and its staff treat guest safety and wellbeing as a top priority and take every reasonable precaution accordingly\056 Even so\054 neither the Lodge nor its owners\054 directors\054 staff or representatives can be held responsible for injury\054 illness\054 death\054 loss\054 damage\054 theft\054 delays\054 cancellations\054 or itinerary changes that result from factors outside its reasonable control or from taking part in safari activities\056\n\nShould operational\054 safety or environmental factors require it\054 Manyoni Ridge Safari Lodge reserves the right to amend\054 suspend or cancel any activity or itinerary\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 2359 0 R
     /Pg 576 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

