2362 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Manyoni Ridge Safari Lodge will not be held responsible for delays\054 changes\054 cancellations or an inability to meet its obligations when these result from events outside its reasonable control\056 This includes\054 among others\054 acts of God\054 natural disasters\054 flooding\054 fires\054 severe weather\054 epidemics or pandemics\054 war\054 terrorism\054 civil unrest\054 strikes\054 government\055imposed restrictions\054 or any other force majeure event\056\n\nIf a reservation is impacted by such circumstances\054 the Lodge reserves the right to alter or cancel the booking\056 Where appropriate\054 it will make reasonable efforts to issue a suitable refund\054 minus any costs it has already incurred and cannot recover\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 2363 0 R
