2389 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Before departing\054 guests should check with their travel advisor\054 the relevant embassy or consulate for up\055to\055date information on visa requirements\054 passport validity\054 regulations concerning travelling with children\054 health prerequisites and any travel advisories in effect\056\n\nEach traveller is responsible for making sure all documentation and health requirements needed for entry into South Africa are properly met\056 Manyoni Ridge Safari Lodge cannot be held liable if a guest is refused boarding\054 denied entry into South Africa\054 or prevented from continuing their journey due to missing documentation or non\055compliance with applicable travel requirements\056)
