  << /ActualText (Manyoni Ridge Safari Lodge is located in an area with a low malaria risk\056 Before travelling\054 guests are encouraged to speak with their doctor or a travel health clinic about recommended vaccinations and whether anti\055malarial medication may be advisable\056)
