2393 0 obj
  << /ActualText (To secure your reservation\054 the following payment terms apply\072\015\nIndividual Reservations \015\nA 30\045 deposit is required to confirm your reservation\015\nThe remaining balance is payable 60 days prior to arrival\n\nGroup Reservations \0503 Rooms or More\051\015\nA 30\045 non\055refundable deposit is required to confirm your reservation\nThe remaining balance is payable 90 days prior to arrival\015\n\nExclusive\055Use Reservations\nA 30\045 non\055refundable deposit to confirm your reservation\015\nThe remaining balance is payable 120 days prior to arrival\054 subject to management approval\n\nLast Minute Bookings\015\nReservations made within 60 days of arrival require full pre\055payment at the time of booking to secure the reservation\015)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 2394 0 R
     /Pg 1190 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
