2427 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Manyoni Ridge Safari Lodge takes pride in offering an intimate\054 exclusive safari experience\056 Because we operate as a boutique lodge with a limited number of rooms and a large share of exclusive\055use and single\055party bookings\054 late cancellations can have a considerable financial impact\056 Our booking and cancellation terms are structured with this in mind \204 to protect the lodge\047s long\055term sustainability while remaining fair to guests and travel partners alike\056\n\nThank you for your understanding\054 and we look forward to hosting you at Manyoni Ridge Safari Lodge for a safari to remember\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 2428 0 R
     /Pg 2186 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

