  << /ActualText (To help us deliver the best possible personalised experience\054 guests are asked to inform our Reservations Department of any dietary needs\054 food allergies\054 medical conditions\054 mobility requirements or special occasions at least 14 days before arrival\056\n\nManyoni Ridge Safari Lodge is able to cater for most medically necessary dietary requirements\056 Every effort will be made to accommodate dietary preferences based on religion or lifestyle\054 though these cannot be guaranteed\056)
